keryx agents external — inspect the external agent registry (read-only, spends no quota)

Usage
  keryx agents external list [--json] [--no-probe]
  keryx agents external probe <id> [--json]

Options
  --json      Emit the registry + availability document as JSON.
  --no-probe  Skip detection entirely; every entry reports `not-probed`.
