src/commands/sandbox.test.ts:
keryx sandbox status

Platform: linux
Launcher: not found (bubblewrap (bwrap)) — bubblewrap (bwrap) not found on PATH; install it (apt install bubblewrap / dnf install bubblewrap)

Capability matrix (this platform):
  - Filesystem containment: requires bubblewrap (bwrap); launcher not installed.
  - Network OFF: requires bubblewrap (bwrap); launcher not installed.
  - Domain allowlist (--allowed-domains): not implemented on this platform — installing the OS sandbox launcher would not change this.
  - Credential masking (--mask-env): not implemented on this platform — installing the OS sandbox launcher would not change this.

This is a report, not a gate — it always exits 0. A contained run still fails closed regardless of what this prints; nothing here changes that behaviour.
