Platform: win32
Launcher: not found — OS sandbox unsupported on platform "win32"

Capability matrix (this platform):
  - Filesystem containment: not implemented on this platform ("win32") — the OS sandbox has no support for this platform at all.
  - Network OFF: not implemented on this platform ("win32") — the OS sandbox has no support for this platform at all.
  - Domain allowlist (--allowed-domains): not implemented on this platform ("win32") — the OS sandbox has no support for this platform at all.
  - Credential masking (--mask-env): not implemented on this platform ("win32") — the OS sandbox has no support for this platform at all.

This is a report, not a gate — it always exits 0. A contained run still fails closed regardless of what this prints; nothing here changes that behaviour.
